ial backoff\\n- Optimized API endpoint for file list retrieval\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Consistent file pane updates\\n- Reduced network overhead\\n- No connection-related UI glitches\\n- Graceful handling of network interruptions"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Gaib32HUaQz1HGDCuF2Mhe', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement', 'description': 'Replace current file update mechanism with a robust solution using efficient backend tracking and intelligent polling to eliminate stability issues in the files pane'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Gaib32HUaQz1HGDCuF2Mhe', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "69ceb950", "message": "Created project: Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement", "summary": {"project_id": "69ceb950", "project_name": "Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement", "description": "Replace current file update mechanism with a robust solution using efficient backend tracking and intelligent polling to eliminate stability issues in the files pane", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:59:01.472605", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:59:01.472605", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:59:01.472605", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01CqeeuSjyRYw4xSmTLQGncf', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '69ceb950', 'category': 'general', 'note': 'Starting project to improve file pane stability. Requirements call for replacing unstable update mechanism with hybrid approach using efficient backend tracking and intelligent polling with exponential backoff.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01CqeeuSjyRYw4xSmTLQGncf', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UtUyvSvGP2PTuRv648CFhk', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# File Pane Stability Improvement - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nReplace the current unreliable file update mechanism with a robust hybrid solution using efficient backend file tracking and intelligent polling with exponential backoff.\n\n## Milestone 1: Backend File Tracking Infrastructure (Priority: High)\n**Objective**: Implement efficient backend file change tracking system\n**Deliverables**:\n- File change detection API endpoint\n- Optimized file metadata caching\n- Last-modified timestamp tracking\n- Bulk file status check endpoint\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- API endpoint returns file changes since timestamp\n- Minimal database/filesystem overhead\n- Consistent file metadata tracking\n- Response time under 100ms for typical requests\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n**Estimated Effort**: 3-4 days\n\n## Milestone 2: Intelligent Polling Frontend (Priority: High) \n**Objective**: Replace current update mechanism with smart polling\n**Deliverables**:\n- Exponential backoff polling strategy\n- Network interruption handling\n- Optimized state management\n- Graceful degradation for offline scenarios\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Polling frequency adapts to activity level\n- No UI glitches during network issues\n- Memory efficient state updates\n- Consistent user experience maintained\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 (Backend API)\n**Estimated Effort**: 4-5 days\n\n## Milestone 3: Performance Optimization & Testing (Priority: Medium)\n**Objective**: Optimize performance and ensure reliability\n**Deliverables**:\n- Performance benchmarks\n- Load testing results  \n- Error handling refinements\n- Documentation updates\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Reduced network overhead vs current implementation\n- Handles 100+ concurrent file operations\n- Error recovery within 5 seconds\n- Complete API documentation\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 & 2\n**Estimated Effort**: 2-3 days\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Consistent file pane updates (99%+ reliability)\n- Reduced network overhead (target: 30% reduction)\n- No connection-related UI glitches\n- Network interruption recovery under 5 seconds\n\n## Total Project Timeline: 9-12 days'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UtUyvSvGP2PTuRv648CFhk', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_025916.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_025916.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016YzHMLfCk2YGEE3aaVMiFx', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'project_name': 'Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016YzHMLfCk2YGEE3aaVMiFx', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "architecture_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md", "message": "Comprehensive architecture proposal for Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement, focusing on a robust hybrid polling strategy with efficient file synchronization", "key_decisions": ["Implement hybrid polling with exponential backoff", "Use React and Redux for frontend state management", "Create lightweight backend file change tracker", "Design resilient error handling and reconnection strategy"], "self_analysis": "The proposed architecture successfully addresses the core requirements by providing a nuanced approach to file synchronization. The design balances performance, reliability, and simplicity while adhering to the specified constraints. The exponential backoff and comprehensive error handling strategies demonstrate a thoughtful solution to potential network instabilities."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_018Rc9cuA1tjdzYoXs6GyvYc', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_018Rc9cuA1tjdzYoXs6GyvYc', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement - Architecture Proposal\\n\\n## Architecture Overview\\nA robust, event-driven file synchronization system designed to provide real-time file updates with minimal performance overhead and maximum reliability.\\n\\n## Technology Stack\\n- **Frontend**: React with TypeScript\\n- **State Management**: Redux for predictable state updates\\n- **Backend Communication**: Axios for API requests\\n- **File Change Detection**: Hybrid polling strategy\\n\\n## System Components\\n\\n### 1. Frontend File Synchronization Module\\n- **Responsibilities**:\\n  - Manage file list state\\n  - Coordinate file update requests\\n  - Handle network resilience\\n- **Key Features**:\\n  - Exponential backoff polling mechanism\\n  - Intelligent update throttling\\n  - Optimistic UI updates\\n\\n### 2. Backend File Change Tracker\\n- **Responsibilities**:\\n  - Efficiently track file system changes\\n  - Provide optimized file list endpoint\\n  - Minimize computational overhead\\n- **Implementation**:\\n  - Lightweight file system watcher\\n  - Cached file metadata\\n  - Minimal state persistence\\n\\n## Polling Strategy Flowchart\\n```\\n[Client] \\u2192 [Request File List] \\n  \\u2193 (Exponential Backoff)\\n[Backend File Tracker]\\n  \\u2193 (Efficient Metadata Retrieval)\\n[Filtered File Changes]\\n  \\u2193 \\n[Client State Update]\\n```\\n\\n## Data Flow\\n1. Initial file list request on component mount\\n2. Periodic polling with exponential backoff\\n3. Backend provides delta updates\\n4. Frontend applies state changes\\n5. Graceful error handling and retry logic\\n\\n## Exponential Backoff Algorithm\\n- Initial poll interval: 1 second\\n- Maximum interval: 30 seconds\\n- Backoff formula: `min(initialInterval * (2 ^ attempts), maxInterval)`\\n\\n## Error Handling\\n- Network failure detection\\n- Automatic reconnection attempts\\n- User-friendly error notifications\\n- Fallback to last known state\\n\\n## Performance Considerations\\n- Limit polling frequency\\n- Use minimal payload size\\n- Implement client-side caching\\n- Defer updates during low visibility\\n\\n## Security\\n- Use secure, authenticated API endpoints\\n- Implement request rate limiting\\n- Validate all incoming file metadata\\n\\n## Alternatives Considered\\n1. WebSockets (Rejected: Violates constraints)\\n2. Continuous long-polling (Rejected: High overhead)\\n3. Server-Sent Events (Considered, but complex implementation)\\n\\n## Risks and Mitigations\\n- **Risk**: Network instability\\n  **Mitigation**: Exponential backoff, resilient state management\\n- **Risk**: High CPU usage\\n  **Mitigation**: Intelligent polling, throttling mechanisms\\n\\n## Open Questions\\n- Precise polling interval configuration\\n- Conflict resolution for simultaneous updates\\n- Handling large file system changes\\n\\n## Testing Strategy\\n- Unit tests for polling logic\\n- Integration tests for state management\\n- Performance benchmarks\\n- Network failure simulation tests"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MGaTmr2hJfkmjVzvtcbWdM', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Backend File Tracking Infrastructure - Implement efficient backend file change tracking system with file change detection API endpoint, optimized file metadata caching, last-modified timestamp tracking, and bulk file status check endpoint', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MGaTmr2hJfkmjVzvtcbWdM', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 8, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "dependencies": ["Task 2 depends on Task 1 (Models)", "Task 3 depends on Task 2 (Cache Service)", "Task 4 depends on Tasks 2 and 3", "Task 5 depends on Task 2", "Task 6 depends on Task 2", "Task 8 depends on Task 3", "Task 7 is independent"], "message": "Created 8 backend tasks for File Tracking Infrastructure milestone. Tasks cover: file metadata models, in-memory cache service, filesystem watcher, file change detection API, single file status endpoint, bulk status check endpoint, rate limiting middleware, and health check endpoint. Implementation follows a 4-phase approach: Foundation (models, rate limiting), Core Services (cache), File Watching (watcher), and API Endpoints (all endpoints in parallel). Estimated 24 hours total development time. All tasks include acceptance criteria and are ready for TDD Coordinator implementation."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015rnUtaXJ6KAZEorh1Zq3gr', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/frontend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Intelligent Polling Frontend - Replace current update mechanism with smart polling using exponential backoff polling strategy, network interruption handling, optimized state management, and graceful degradation for offline scenarios', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m2.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015rnUtaXJ6KAZEorh1Zq3gr', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 18, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m2.md", "dependencies": ["Task 1 (Polling Service) \\u2192 Task 2 (Redux Slice) \\u2192 Task 3 (RTK Query)", "Task 1 \\u2192 Task 4 (Container) \\u2192 Task 5 (Display) \\u2192 Task 6 (Item)", "Task 1,2 \\u2192 Task 7 (useFilePolling) \\u2192 Task 8 (useFileList)", "Task 1 \\u2192 Task 9 (Strategies) \\u2192 Task 10 (Error Handling) \\u2192 Task 11 (Offline)", "Task 5,11 \\u2192 Task 12 (Status) \\u2192 Task 13 (Virtualization)", "Task 1,2 \\u2192 Task 15 (Memory) \\u2192 Task 14 (Animations) \\u2192 Task 16 (Config) \\u2192 Task 17 (Debug)", "All tasks \\u2192 Task 18 (Integration Tests)"], "message": "Successfully broke down intelligent polling frontend milestone into 18 specific tasks organized in 5 spri