rts arbitrary category names like \\"favorite_tacos\\"\\n4. **Icon Support**: Emoji icons are supported in the current UI\\n5. **Trigger Flexibility**: System can handle various trigger conditions for new achievements\\n\\n## Implementation Approach\\n\\n1. **Analysis Phase**: Examine existing achievement definitions and storage structure\\n2. **Design Phase**: Create 10 achievement definitions following existing patterns\\n3. **Integration Phase**: Add achievements to the system storage\\n4. **Validation Phase**: Test that achievements trigger and display correctly\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Status:** Requirements Complete - Ready for Development Manager  \\n**Next Step:** Spawn Development Manager to implement the favorite tacos achievements"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016eARxAdz8YSPbHnKBT4AAf', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Favorite Tacos Achievements', 'description': 'Add 10 new achievements from the "Favorite Tacos" category to the existing ensemble agent achievements system'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016eARxAdz8YSPbHnKBT4AAf', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "89ca274c", "message": "Created project: Favorite Tacos Achievements", "summary": {"project_id": "89ca274c", "project_name": "Favorite Tacos Achievements", "description": "Add 10 new achievements from the \\"Favorite Tacos\\" category to the existing ensemble agent achievements system", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T03:06:47.718624", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T03:06:47.718624", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T03:06:47.718624", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Favorite Tacos Achievements\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', '