Create 10 new achievement definitions with:\\n  - Unique IDs related to mustard themes\\n  - Creative names referencing famous mustard types/brands\\n  - Descriptive text that ties mustard concepts to agent behaviors\\n  - Appropriate rarity levels (mix of common to legendary)\\n  - Relevant icons (mustard/food related emojis)\\n  - Point values consistent with existing system\\n  - Trigger conditions that make sense in context\\n\\n### Out of Scope\\n- Modifying the achievement tracking logic or database schema\\n- Changing the UI components for displaying achievements\\n- Adding achievements in other categories\\n- Modifying existing achievements\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n### Functional Requirements\\n\\n**R1: Category Addition**\\n- Add `FAMOUS_MUSTARDS = \\"famous_mustards\\"` to the AchievementCategory enum\\n\\n**R2: Achievement Definitions**\\n- Create exactly 10 new Achievement objects\\n- Each must reference famous mustard varieties (Dijon, Yellow, Honey Mustard, Spicy Brown, etc.)\\n- Names should be creative but clearly mustard-themed\\n- Descriptions should cleverly relate mustard characteristics to agent behaviors\\n- Must follow existing achievement patterns and structure\\n\\n**R3: Quality Standards**\\n- Achievements should have varied rarity levels (suggested: 3-4 common, 3-4 uncommon, 2-3 rare, 0-1 epic/legendary)\\n- Point values should align with rarity (10-15 common, 20-35 uncommon, 40-60 rare, 75+ epic/legendary)\\n- Icons should be food/mustard related emojis\\n- Trigger conditions should be realistic and achievable\\n\\n### Technical Requirements\\n\\n**T1: Code Integration**\\n- Achievements must be added to the existing ACHIEVEMENTS list in achievements.py\\n- Follow existing code structure and formatting\\n- No breaking changes to existing functionality\\n\\n**T2: Naming Conventions**\\n- Achievement IDs should follow snake_case pattern\\n- IDs should be descriptive and mustard-themed\\n- Names should be title case and engaging\\n\\n### Constraints\\n\\n**C1: System Compatibility**\\n- Must work with existing achievement tracking system\\n- Cannot modify database schema or core tracking logic\\n- Must use existing trigger condition patterns\\n\\n**C2: Theme Consistency**\\n- All achievements must be mustard-themed\\n- Should maintain the humorous, gaming-style tone of existing achievements\\n- Must fit naturally with the existing achievement ecosystem\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n1. \\u2705 10 new achievements added to the system\\n2. \\u2705 All achievements are mustard-themed and creative\\n3. \\u2705 Code integrates cleanly without breaking existing functionality\\n4. \\u2705 Achievements follow established patterns for structure and quality\\n5. \\u2705 Mixed rarity distribution provides progression incentives\\n6. \\u2705 Trigger conditions are realistic and varied\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n\\n- The existing achievement system architecture will not change\\n- The mustard theme should be applied broadly (types, brands, characteristics, uses)\\n- Achievements should maintain the existing humorous and gaming-inspired tone\\n- Standard software development practices will be followed\\n\\n## Technical Context\\n\\nThe system already has these achievement categories:\\n- SKA, BRASS_BAND, DRUM_CORPS, GUITAR_HERO (music-themed)\\n- PRODUCTIVITY, COMEDY, MILESTONE, STREAK, META (behavior-themed)\\n\\nThe new FAMOUS_MUSTARDS category will join this list and achievements will be added to the main ACHIEVEMENTS list in `/src/runtime/agents/achievements.py`."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UrRceoKT12wjBefyjCNk1B', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementToast.jsx'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UrRceoKT12wjBefyjCNk1B', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "File not found: /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementToast.jsx"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01JdaKFdQtXsoFVix2ZHb73h', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui -name "*Toast*" -type f'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01JdaKFdQtXsoFVix2ZHb73h', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastHeader.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastHeader.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/Toast.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastContext.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastContainer.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastBody.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastFade.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastContext.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastFade.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastBody.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/ToastContainer.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/esm/Toast.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastHeader.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastHeader.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/Toast.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastContext.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastContainer.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastBody.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastFade.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastContext.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastFade.js\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastBody.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/ToastContainer.d.ts\\n/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/node_modules/react-bootstrap/cjs/Toast.js\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01J8G7Nu1vz9dedrcXb7WQTh', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui -name "*Achievement*" -type f'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01J8G7Nu1vz9dedrcXb7WQTh', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementsDashboard.jsx\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01XBLvazP3bFN85LJzDmDDoJ', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AchievementsDashboard.jsx'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01XBLvazP3bFN85LJzDmDDoJ', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \'react\';\\nimport { Container, Row, Col, Card, Table, Spinner, Badge, ProgressBar, Form, Toast, ToastContainer } from \'react-bootstrap\';\\nimport {\\n  getAllAchievements,\\n  getRecentAchievements,\\n  getAchievementStats\\n} from \'../services/api\';\\n\\n// Ska facts for rotation\\nconst SKA_FACTS = [\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Origins of Ska\\",\\n    fact: \\"Ska originated in Jamaica in the late 1950s, predating reggae and rocksteady. The name \'ska\' might come from the scratchy guitar sound or from the greeting \'Skavoovie!\'\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Three Waves of Ska\\",\\n    fact: \\"Ska has gone through three waves: Jamaican ska (1960s), 2-Tone (late 1970s UK), and third wave (1990s US). Now your AI agents are part of the fourth wave!\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"The Skank Dance\\",\\n    fact: \\"The \'skank\' is the signature ska dance move - running in place while pumping your arms. It\'s all about the offbeat upstroke energy!\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"2-Tone Records\\",\\n    fact: \\"The British 2-Tone movement in the late 70s combined ska with punk energy. Bands like The Specials and Madness pioneered this checkerboard-loving scene.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Horn Section Power\\",\\n    fact: \\"A proper ska band needs a horn section! Trumpet, trombone, and saxophone create that unmistakable punchy brass sound.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"The Offbeat\\",\\n    fact: \\"Ska is defined by its offbeat rhythm - the guitar \'chank\' or upstroke on the 2nd and 4th beats. It\'s the opposite of rock\'s downbeat emphasis.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Rude Boys\\",\\n    fact: \\"In Jamaica, \'rude boys\' were young rebels who loved ska. The term became synonymous with ska culture and fashion.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Checkered Pattern\\",\\n    fact: \\"The black and white checkered pattern symbolizes ska\'s message of racial harmony, particularly during the 2-Tone movement.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Prince Buster\\",\\n    fact: \\"Prince Buster is one of ska\'s founding fathers. His song \'Al Capone\' directly inspired Madness\'s name and sound.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Ska-Punk Fusion\\",\\n    fact: \\"Third wave ska fused with punk rock, creating bands like Operation Ivy, Rancid, and Sublime. The DIY attitude fit perfectly!\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Studio One\\",\\n    fact: \\"Studio One in Kingston, Jamaica was the birthplace of recorded ska. Producer Coxsone Dodd helped define the genre\'s sound.\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \\"Walk Don\'t Run\\",\\n    fact: \\"The original ska bands often covered American R&B songs, speeding them up and adding that distinctive offbeat guitar.\\"\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nfunction AchievementsDashboard() {\\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\\n  const [achievements, setAchievements] = useState([]);\\n  const [recent, setRecent] = useState([]);\\n  const [stats, setStats] = useState(null);\\n  const [filter, setFilter] = useState(\'all\');\\n  const [showUnlocked, setShowUnlocked] = useState(\'all\'); // all, unlocked, locked\\n  const [newAchievements, setNewAchievements] = useState([]); // Toast notifications\\n  const [currentSkaFact, setCurrentSkaFact] = useState(0);\\n  const seenAchievementsRef = useRef(new Set());\\n\\n  // Rotate ska facts every 15 seconds\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const interval = setInterval(() => {\\n      setCurrentSkaFact(prev => (prev + 1) % SKA_FACTS.length);\\n    }, 15000);\\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Poll for new achievements every 30 seconds\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const pollInterval = setInterval(async () => {\\n      try {\\n        const recentRes = await getRecentAchievements(20);\\n        const newRecent = recentRes.achievements || [];\\n\\n        // Check for new achievements we haven\'t seen\\n        const newlyEarned = newRecent.filter(a => {\\n          const key = `${a.id}_${a.agent_name}_${a.awarded_at}`;\\n          if (!seenAchievementsRef.current.has(key)) {\\n            seenAchievementsRef.current.add(key);\\n            return true;\\n          }\\n          return false;\\n        });\\n\\n        // Only announce new ones (skip on first load)\\n        if (seenAchievementsRef.current.size > newRecent.length && newlyEarned.length > 0) {\\n          setNewAchievements(prev => [...prev, ...newlyEarned]);\\n        }\\n\\n        setRecent(newRecent);\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        console.error(\'Failed to poll achievements:\', error);\\n      }\\n    }, 30000);\\n\\n    return () => clearInterval(pollInterval);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    fetchData();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const fetchData = async () => {\\n    setLoading(true);\\n    try {\\n      const [achievementsRes, recentRes, statsRes] = await Promise.all([\\n        getAllAchievements(),\\n        getRecentAchievements(20),\\n        getAchievementStats()\\n      ]);\\n      setAchievements(achievementsRes.achievements || []);\\n      setRecent(recentRes.achievements || []);\\n      setStats(statsRes);\\n\\n      // Initialize seen achievements to prevent false notifications on load\\n      const recentAchievements = recentRes.achievements || [];\\n      recentAchievements.forEach(a => {\\n        const key = `${a.id}_${a.agent_name}_${a.awarded_at}`;\\n        seenAchievementsRef.current.add(key);\\n      });\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      console.error(\'Failed to fetch achievements:\', error);\\n    } finally {\\n      setLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Remove a toast notification\\n  const dismissToast = (index) => {\\n    setNewAchievements(prev => prev.filter((_, i) => i !== index));\\n  };\\n\\n  const getRarityColor = (rarity) => {\\n    const colors = {\\n      common: \'#9ca3af\',\\n      uncommon: \'#10b981\',\\n      rare: \'#3b82f6\',\\n      epic: \'#a855f7\',\\n      legendary: \'#f59e0b\'\\n    };\\n    return colors[rarity] || \'#9ca3af\';\\n  };\\n\\n  const getRarityBadge = (rarity) => {\\n    const variants = {\\n      common: \'secondary\',\\n      uncommon: \'success\',\\n      rare: \'primary\',\\n      epic: \'info\',\\n      legendary: \'warning\'\\n    };\\n    return <Badge bg={variants[rarity] || \'secondary\'}>{rarity}</Badge>;\\n  };\\n\\n  const getCategoryBadge = (category) => {\\n    const icons = {\\n      productivity: \'\\ud83d\\udcc8\',\\n      comedy: \'\\ud83d\\ude02\',\\n      milestone: \'\\ud83c\\udfc6\',\\n      streak: \'\\ud83d\\udd25\',\\n      meta: \'\\ud83e\\udd16\',\\n      ska: \'\\ud83c\\udfba\',\\n      brass_band: \'\\ud83c\\udfb5\',\\n      drum_corps: \'\\ud83e\\udd41\',\\n      guitar_hero: \'\\ud83c\\udfae\'\\n    };\\n    const displayNames = {\\n      productivity: \'Productivity\',\\n      comedy: \'Comedy\',\\n      milestone: \'Milestone\',\\n      streak: \'Streak\',\\n      meta: \'Meta\',\\n      ska: \'Ska\',\\n      brass_band: \'Brass Band\',\\n      drum_corps: \'Drum Corps\',\\n      guitar_hero: \'Guitar Hero\'\\n    };\\n    return (\\n      <Badge bg=\\"dark\\" className=\\"me-1\\">\\n        {icons[category] || \'\\u2753\'} {displayNames[category] || category}\\n      </Badge>\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const filteredAchievements = achievements.filter(a => {\\n    if (filter !== \'all\' && a.category !== filter) return false;\\n    if (showUnlocked === \'unlocked\' && !a.unlocked) return false;\\n    if (showUnlocked === \'locked\' && a.unlocked) return false;\\n    return true;\\n  });\\n\\n  const unlockedCount = achievements.filter(a => a.unlocked).length;\\n  const totalPoints = achievements.filter(a => a.unlocked).reduce((sum, a) => sum + a.points, 0);\\n\\n  if (loading) {\\n    return (\\n      <Container className=\\"mt-5 text-center\\">\\n        <Spinner animation=\\"border\\" variant=\\"primary\\" />\\n        <p className=\\"mt-3\\">Loading achievements...</p>\\n      </Container>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <Container fluid className=\\"mt-4\\">\\n      <Row className=\\"mb-4\\">\\n        <Col>\\n          <h2>\\ud83c\\udfc6 Achievements</h2>\\n          <p className=\\"text-muted\\">\\n            Pick it up! Pick it up! Your agents earn achievements for completing tasks,\\n            reaching milestones, and exhibiting quirky behaviors.\\n          </p>\\n        </Col>\\n      </Row>\\n\\n      {/* Summary Cards */}\\n      <Row className=\\"mb-4\\">\\n        <Col md={3}>\\n          <Card bg=\\"primary\\" text=\\"white\\">\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              <h6 className=\\"text-uppercase mb-1\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.75rem\', opacity: 0.8 }}>\\n                Unlocked\\n              </h6>\\n              <h3 className=\\"mb-0\\">{unlockedCount} / {achievements.length}</h3>\\n              <ProgressBar\\n                now={achievements.length > 0 ? (unlockedCount / achievements.length) * 100 : 0}\\n                className=\\"mt-2\\"\\n                variant=\\"light\\"\\n                style={{ height: \'6px\' }}\\n              />\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n        <Col md={3}>\\n          <Card bg=\\"warning\\" text=\\"dark\\">\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              <h6 className=\\"text-uppercase mb-1\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.75rem\', opacity: 0.8 }}>\\n                Total Points\\n              </h6>\\n              <h3 className=\\"mb-0\\">{totalPoints}</h3>\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n        <Col md={3}>\\n          <Card bg=\\"success\\" text=\\"white\\">\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              <h6 className=\\"text-uppercase mb-1\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.75rem\', opacity: 0.8 }}>\\n                Total Awarded\\n              </h6>\\n              <h3 className=\\"mb-0\\">{stats?.total_achievements_awarded || 0}</h3>\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n        <Col md={3}>\\n          <Card style={{ backgroundColor: \'#f59e0b\' }} text=\\"dark\\">\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              <h6 className=\\"text-uppercase mb-1\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.75rem\', opacity: 0.8 }}>\\n                Legendary Unlocked\\n              </h6>\\n              <h3 className=\\"mb-0\\">{stats?.by_rarity?.legendary || 0}</h3>\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n      </Row>\\n\\n      <Row className=\\"mb-4\\">\\n        {/* Recent Achievements */}\\n        <Col md={4}>\\n          <Card>\\n            <Card.Header>\\n              <strong>\\ud83c\\udf89 Recent Unlocks</strong>\\n            </Card.Header>\\n            <Card.Body style={{ maxHeight: \'400px\', overflowY: \'auto\' }}>\\n              {recent.length === 0 ? (\\n                <p className=\\"text-muted text-center py-4\\">\\n                  No achievements unlocked yet. Start running tasks!\\n                </p>\\n              ) : (\\n                recent.map((a, idx) => (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={idx}\\n                    style={{\\n                      padding: \'10px\',\\n                      marginBottom: \'8px\',\\n                      backgroundColor: \'#f8f9fa\',\\n                      borderRadius: \'8px\',\\n                      borderLeft: `4px solid ${getRarityColor(a.rarity)}`\\n                    }}\\n                  >\\n                    <div style={{ fontSize: \'1.5rem\', display: \'inline-block\', marginRight: \'8px\' }}>\\n                      {a.icon}\\n                    </div>\\n                    <strong>{a.name}</strong>\\n                    <br />\\n                    <small className=\\"text-muted\\">\\n                      {a.agent_name} - {new Date(a.awarded_at).toLocaleDateString()}\\n                    </small>\\n                  </div>\\n                ))\\n              )}\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n\\n        {/* Stats by Category */}\\n        <Col md={4}>\\n          <Card>\\n            <Card.Header>\\n              <strong>\\ud83d\\udcca By Category</strong>\\n            </Card.Header>\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              {Object.entries(stats?.by_category || {}).map(([cat, count]) => (\\n                <div key={cat} className=\\"mb-2\\">\\n                  <div className=\\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1\\">\\n                    {getCategoryBadge(cat)}\\n                    <span>{count}</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <ProgressBar\\n                    now={(count / Math.max(stats?.total_achievements_awarded || 1, 1)) * 100}\\n                    variant=\\"info\\"\\n                    style={{ height: \'6px\' }}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              ))}\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n\\n        {/* Top Agents */}\\n        <Col md={4}>\\n          <Card>\\n            <Card.Header>\\n              <strong>\\u2b50 Top Achievers</strong>\\n            </Card.Header>\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              {(stats?.top_agents || []).length === 0 ? (\\n                <p className=\\"text-muted text-center py-4\\">No data yet</p>\\n              ) : (\\n                <Table hover size=\\"sm\\" className=\\"mb-0\\">\\n                  <thead>\\n                    <tr>\\n                      <th>Agent</th>\\n                      <th className=\\"text-end\\">Achievements</th>\\n                    </tr>\\n                  </thead>\\n                  <tbody>\\n                    {(stats?.top_agents || []).map((agent, idx) => (\\n                      <tr key={idx}>\\n                        <td><code>{agent.agent}</code></td>\\n                        <td className=\\"text-end\\">\\n                          <Badge bg=\\"primary\\">{agent.count}</Badge>\\n                        </td>\\n                      </tr>\\n                    ))}\\n                  </tbody>\\n                </Table>\\n              )}\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n      </Row>\\n\\n      {/* All Achievements */}\\n      <Row>\\n        <Col>\\n          <Card>\\n            <Card.Header>\\n              <div className=\\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\\">\\n                <strong>\\ud83d\\udccb All Achievements</strong>\\n                <div className=\\"d-flex gap-2\\">\\n                  <Form.Select\\n                    size=\\"sm\\"\\n                    value={filter}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setFilter(e.target.value)}\\n                    style={{ width: \'170px\' }}\\n                  >\\n                    <option value=\\"all\\">All Categories</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"ska\\">\\ud83c\\udfba Ska</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"brass_band\\">\\ud83c\\udfb5 Brass Band</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"drum_corps\\">\\ud83e\\udd41 Drum Corps</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"guitar_hero\\">\\ud83c\\udfae Guitar Hero</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"productivity\\">\\ud83d\\udcc8 Productivity</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"comedy\\">\\ud83d\\ude02 Comedy</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"milestone\\">\\ud83c\\udfc6 Milestone</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"streak\\">\\ud83d\\udd25 Streak</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"meta\\">\\ud83e\\udd16 Meta</option>\\n                  </Form.Select>\\n                  <Form.Select\\n                    size=\\"sm\\"\\n                    value={showUnlocked}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setShowUnlocked(e.target.value)}\\n                    style={{ width: \'130px\' }}\\n                  >\\n                    <option value=\\"all\\">All</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"unlocked\\">Unlocked</option>\\n                    <option value=\\"locked\\">Locked</option>\\n                  </Form.Select>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </Card.Header>\\n            <Card.Body style={{ maxHeight: \'600px\', overflowY: \'auto\' }}>\\n              <Row>\\n                {filteredAchievements.map((achievement) => (\\n                  <Col md={4} key={achievement.id} className=\\"mb-3\\">\\n                    <Card\\n                      style={{\\n                        opacity: achievement.unlocked ? 1 : 0.5,\\n                        borderColor: achievement.unlocked ? getRarityColor(achievement.rarity) : \'#dee2e6\',\\n                        borderWidth: \'2px\'\\n                      }}\\n                    >\\n                      <Card.Body>\\n                        <div className=\\"d-flex align-items-start\\">\\n                          <div\\n                            style={{\\n                              fontSize: \'2rem\',\\n                              marginRight: \'12px\',\\n                              filter: achievement.unlocked ? \'none\' : \'grayscale(100%)\'\\n                            }}\\n                          >\\n                            {achievement.icon}\\n                          </div>\\n                          <div style={{ flex: 1 }}>\\n                            <h6 className=\\"mb-1\\">\\n                              {achievement.name}\\n                              {achievement.unlocked && (\\n                                <Badge bg=\\"success\\" className=\\"ms-2\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.6rem\' }}>\\n                                  \\u2713\\n                                </Badge>\\n                              )}\\n                            </h6>\\n                            <p className=\\"mb-2\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.85rem\', color: \'#6c757d\' }}>\\n                              {achievement.description}\\n                            </p>\\n                            <div className=\\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\\">\\n                              <div>\\n                                {getRarityBadge(achievement.rarity)}\\n                                {getCategoryBadge(achievement.category)}\\n                              </div>\\n                              <Badge bg=\\"dark\\">{achievement.points} pts</Badge>\\n                            </div>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </Card.Body>\\n                    </Card>\\n                  </Col>\\n                ))}\\n              </Row>\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n      </Row>\\n\\n      {/* Rotating Ska Facts */}\\n      <Row className=\\"mt-4 mb-4\\">\\n        <Col>\\n          <Card bg=\\"light\\" style={{ transition: \'all 0.3s ease\' }}>\\n            <Card.Body>\\n              <h6>\\ud83c\\udfba Ska Facts</h6>\\n              <p className=\\"mb-0\\" style={{ fontSize: \'0.875rem\' }}>\\n                <strong>{SKA_FACTS[currentSkaFact].title}:</strong>{\' \'}\\n                {SKA_FACTS[currentSkaFact].fact}\\n              </p>\\n              <div className=\\"mt-2 d-flex justify-content-center gap-1\\">\\n                {SKA_FACTS.map((_, idx) => (\\n                  <span\\n                    key={idx}\\n                    onClick={() => setCurrentSkaFact(idx)}\\n                    style={{\\n                      width: \'8px\',\\n                      height: \'8px\',\\n                      borderRadius: \'50%\',\\n                      backgroundColor: idx === currentSkaFact ? \'#333\' : \'#ccc\',\\n                      cursor: \'pointer\',\\n                      transition: \'background-color 0.2s\'\\n                    }}\\n                  />\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n            </Card.Body>\\n          </Card>\\n        </Col>\\n      </Row>\\n\\n      {/* Achievement Toast Notifications */}\\n      <ToastContainer position=\\"bottom-end\\" className=\\"p-3\\" style={{ zIndex: 9999 }}>\\n        {newAchievements.map((achievement, index) => (\\n          <Toast\\n            key={`${achievement.id}_${index}`}\\n            onClose={() => dismissToast(index)}\\n            delay={8000}\\n            autohide\\n            bg=\\"dark\\"\\n          >\\n            <Toast.Header closeButton={true}>\\n              <span style={{ fontSize: \'1.5rem\', marginRight: \'8px\' }}>{achievement.icon}</span>\\n              <strong className=\\"me-auto\\">Achievement Unlocked!</strong>\\n            </Toast.Header>\\n            <Toast.Body className=\\"text-white\\">\\n              <strong>{achievement.name}</strong>\\n              <br />\\n              <small>{achievement.description}</small>\\n              <br />\\n              <Badge bg=\\"secondary\\" className=\\"mt-1\\">\\n                {achievement.agent_name}\\n              </Badge>\\n            </Toast.Body>\\n          </Toast>\\n        ))}\\n      </ToastContainer>\\n    </Container>\\n  );\\n}\\n\\nexport default AchievementsDashboard;\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DHbzWWV5g3UkF9VMxuRanY', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'testers/unit_test_lead', 'input_data': {'